.TH WERKMEISTER-MCP 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-mcp \- Launch the werkmeister MCP server over stdio (Claude Desktop, the werkmeister plugin; no token needed)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister mcp\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Launches the werkmeister MCP server over stdio, for Claude Desktop and the werkmeister plugin. The \fBwerkmeister\fR wrapper launches it; \fBwerkmeister connect\fR starts the HTTP modes.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
